{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"qmmb@819","phase":"after","pageId":"page@e46e3902042dbbb033f2a044a44236b8","frameId":"frame@941214c0db882b3459e97dbece0cc366","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:4206/?legacyopening=1","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"en","style":"--visual-height: 839px;"},[[3,53]],[[3,54]],["BODY",{},[[3,55]],["DIV",{"id":"root"},["DIV",{"class":"app-root theme-light reduce-motion"},["DIV",{"class":"device surface-app"},[[2,17]],["DIV",{"class":"phone-content"},["SECTION",{"class":"opening-screen","aria-label":"Sophie Mercer first contact"},["HEADER",{"class":"opening-chat-header"},["BUTTON",{"class":"icon-button bare","aria-label":"Back"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5"}]]],["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar opening-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]],["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Sophie Mercer"],["SMALL",{},"Unknown number · identity unverified"]],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-message-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"}]]],["DIV",{"__playwright_scroll_top_":"857","class":"opening-thread"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-timestamp"},"Thursday 8 October · 08:41"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Hi. I'm sorry for messaging out of nowhere."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry. I know you don't know me. Is this a bad time?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My name is Sophie Mercer."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My brother Daniel gave me this number before he disappeared."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He said if anything happened to him, I should contact you."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He hasn't come home in three days."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Who is Daniel Mercer?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My older brother. He worked with old civic records."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There is a small chat with people close to Daniel. I could add you, if you're comfortable. They don't know why he left your number either."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"You can add me. I will listen first."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm sorry about the group. I thought it would help to explain why Daniel gave me your number."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I didn't tell them everything he left me. He made me keep a page. I can send you a photo, if you still want to see it."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Send it. I will look, but I cannot promise what it means."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's fair. I don't know what it means either."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He left me a handwritten note. I'll send you a photo. Please read it."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-attachment"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"22","height":"22","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-file-image","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"}],["path",{"d":"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"}],["circle",{"cx":"10","cy":"12","r":"2"}],["path",{"d":"m20 17-1.296-1.296a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.408 0L9 22"}]],["SPAN",{},["STRONG",{},"Daniel's handwritten note"],["SMALL",{},"Photo received from Sophie · source unverified"]],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["path",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}]]]],["DIV",{"class":"opening-actions"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-action-heading"},"Reply to Sophie"],["BUTTON",{"aria-pressed":"false","class":"opening-choice "},"What are the originals?"],["BUTTON",{"aria-pressed":"false","class":"opening-choice "},"Why didn't he take it with him?"],["BUTTON",{"aria-pressed":"false","class":"opening-choice "},"Did he explain the recovery token?"],["BUTTON",{"aria-pressed":"false","class":"opening-choice "},"Can you prove this note is his?"],["BUTTON",{"aria-pressed":"false","class":"opening-choice "},"I'll see what I can find."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-primary","disabled":""},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-send","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"}],["path",{"d":"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"}]]," Send message"]]]],[[2,41]]]]],[[3,59]],[[3,60]]]],"viewport":{"width":412,"height":839},"timestamp":2196541.429,"wallTime":1792825237119,"collectionTime":1.199999988079071,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
